    "description": {
      "value": "This copper coin dangles from a leather strip strung through a hole drilled in the center. Until activated, the coin becomes invisible for a few seconds at random intervals every few minutes. When you activate the coin, it casts a 2nd-level invisibility spell on you, lasting until the end of your next turn.\n\nActivate (Free Action); Components envision; Trigger You attempt a Stealth check for initiative, but you haven't rolled yet; Requirements You are a master in Stealth."
